        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5eab6c9f2aa14a7e8e8a38ba91d11b17",
      "statement": "The outbound client enforces a mirrored local guard before anything leaves the machine: client._send refuses task_requests toward friends whose recorded matrix lacks the action or resource scope or whose status is not accepted (PermissionDeniedError), and peer error envelopes are normalized back into local exceptions through the ERROR_MAP so remote rejections map to stable HAAPError types.",
      "evidence": [
